OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 18 DEC
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMark Forrest introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings from the Belfast
OL,13,     GInternational Arts Festival plus
OL,14,     Gthe theme of dance continues with
OL,15,     GStravinsky.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,17,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,18,     GProkofiev's American dreams, a
OL,19,     Gfantastical opera, and a love
OL,20,     Gstory that changed his life.
